 an intimate table for a three-course dining experience\, complemented by e
 xpertly paired wines and engaging conversation.\n\nWith gentle prompts to 
 guide discussion\, the evening unfolds at an easy\, convivial pace—invit
 ing genuine dialogue\, shared stories\, and the opportunity to connect wit
 h fellow members in a warm\, welcoming setting. It’s a refined yet relax
