BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-169178@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20260519T130000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260519T150000
SUMMARY: 90 Minutes of Innovation: Leadership\, Governance and the Long Vie
 w 
LOCATION:The Pub
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free\nAvailability: 1 spot left\
 nStatus: You are on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/
 events/169178\n\n1:00PM Program\, 2:30PM Networking\nWhat does it take to 
 guide institutions\, advise CEOs\, and shape strategy at the highest level
 s across decades of transformation?\n\nIn the latest edition of 90 Minutes
  of Innovation*\, John Werner—venture capitalist\, MIT lecturer\, and *F
 orbes* AI columnist—sits down with David Mussafer\, Chairman of Advent I
 nternational and one of the most influential leaders in global private eq
 uity.\n\nWith a career spanning decades\, Mussafer has helped build Advent
  into one of the world’s top ten private equity firms\, headquartered h
 ere in Boston\, while also advising companies and serving on boards across
  industries. Drawing from the arc of his life’s work\, the conversation
  will weave together personal insights and professional milestones\, offe
 ring a perspective that sits at the intersection of capital\, governance\,
  and long-term value creation—where the biggest decisions are often the 
 least visible.\n\nTogether\, they will explore what great companies and le
 adership teams have in common\, how boards actually function—and how the
 y must evolve—the role of private equity in building\, not just acquirin
 g\, companies\, and how leaders navigate uncertainty\, cycles\, and long-t
 erm strategy. The conversation will also draw on lessons from decades of i
 nvesting across sectors and geographies.\n\nExpect a thoughtful\, behind-t
 he-scenes conversation about how decisions get made at the highest levels�
 ��where governance meets growth\, and strategy meets execution.\n\nFrom bo
 ardrooms to global markets—one stage\, one conversation\, not to be miss
 ed.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Light b
 ites and refreshments will be served.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/169178
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
